                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Denby to Mr.
                            Jernigan.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-08-25"><hi rendition="#small-caps">August</hi> 25,
                            1894</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Dispatch concerning spies not received. Telegraph anything you have to add to
                    previous telegrams.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Denby.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
